<section class="section">
  <div class="failure-preview-grid" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr">
    <div class="failure-preview-card"><div class="fp-header"><span class="tag tag-red">P1 · Critical</span></div><div class="fp-program">Gloves</div><p class="fp-failure">Hand fatigue, contact injury, cold-object handling and sizing remain the most persistent mission limiter across every program on record.</p><div class="fp-header" style="margin-top:1rem"><span style="font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;font-size:.62rem;color:var(--cyan)">0–3yr</span></div><p class="fp-lesson">Digital fit library; instrumented torque testing; TMG swap simplification</p><div class="fp-header" style="margin-top:.75rem"><span style="font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;font-size:.62rem;color:var(--cyan)">3–7yr</span></div><p class="fp-lesson">Active assistance / smart restraint concepts; improved maintainability</p></div>
    <div class="failure-preview-card"><div class="fp-header"><span class="tag tag-red">P1 · Critical</span></div><div class="fp-program">Life Support / Water Loop</div><p class="fp-failure">EVA-23 (2013) demonstrated contamination sensitivity is life-critical, not a nuisance. Separator blockage allowed free water into Parmitano's helmet.</p><div class="fp-header" style="margin-top:1rem"><span style="font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;font-size:.62rem;color:var(--cyan)">0–3yr</span></div><p class="fp-lesson">Redesign separator; add free-water detection; emergency helmet management</p><div class="fp-header" style="margin-top:.75rem"><span style="font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;font-size:.62rem;color:var(--cyan)">3–7yr</span></div><p class="fp-lesson">Modular contamination-tolerant water processing; easier on-orbit maintenance</p></div>
    <div class="failure-preview-card"><div class="fp-header"><span class="tag tag-red">P1 · Critical</span></div><div class="fp-program">Mass / Vehicle Integration</div><p class="fp-failure">xEMU failure demonstrated exploration suit feasibility can collapse on mass allocation alone, not hardware performance.</p><div class="fp-header" style="margin-top:1rem"><span style="font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;font-size:.62rem;color:var(--cyan)">0–3yr</span></div><p class="fp-lesson">Lock mass budgets at subsystem level before elaboration; live allocation model</p></div>
    <div class="failure-preview-card"><div class="fp-header"><span class="tag tag-gold">P2 · High</span></div><div class="fp-program">Supply Chain / Digital Thread</div><p class="fp-failure">Aging Enhanced EMU fleet showed industrial-base fragility can become mission risk independent of hardware condition. OIG 2025 critical flag.</p><div class="fp-header" style="margin-top:1rem"><span style="font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;font-size:.62rem;color:var(--cyan)">0–3yr</span></div><p class="fp-lesson">Map critical parts, alternate suppliers, refurbishment bottlenecks</p><div class="fp-header" style="margin-top:.75rem"><span style="font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;font-size:.62rem;color:var(--cyan)">3–7yr</span></div><p class="fp-lesson">Digital lifecycle traceability with predictive maintenance metrics</p></div>
